Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:35.99,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(920,1)\an1\pos(40,300)\fscx93}Episode 4{\fscx100}    {\fsp4.2}Could You Please Tell Me Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.57,0:01:41.99,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,Hey, Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:44.35,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Walk home with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.78,0:01:46.66,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:49.40,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:52.42,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess, A.K.A. Desumi Magahara,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:56.05,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,is a teenage girl who hides \Nher villainous identity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:01:58.09,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,to attend high school in the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.63,0:02:03.06,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,Don't you have handicrafts club today, Desumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:05.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's off for test prep today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:08.02,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Wanna go for some karaoke, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.30,0:02:10.63,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:12.28,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,What, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:14.19,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,You're a real workaholic, Desumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:19.11,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,You'll never get a boyfriend that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:20.58,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:23.94,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, a boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.94,0:02:25.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,We'll see, I guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:29.63,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:32.21,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Hey, you got a crush on someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:33.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Not telling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.59,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Red Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:37.99,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:42.18,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,F-Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:44.89,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.06,0:02:49.31,sign_3982_28_Shock,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(120,20)}Shock
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:49.31,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.17,0:02:52.34,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I-Isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.80,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,Is that their new Pink he's with?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:58.07,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,It is! She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:01.15,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,You think they're dating or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:02.57,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,They totally might be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.85,0:03:05.20,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,They look really good together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:07.74,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Totally! A real perfect couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:08.83,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Right, Desumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:11.58,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,What's with the face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.99,0:03:15.65,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Huh? Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:16.71,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,Desumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:21.72,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You rarely invite me out like this, Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:24.41,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I'm s-sorry, Fudo-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.41,0:03:25.89,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I know you're really busy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:27.22,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Hey, not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:30.34,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,So, what was it you wanted to ask me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:33.55,main,Haru,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:42.24,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,It {\i0}is{\i1} rude to ask about this, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:45.99,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,But I just can't stop \Nthinking about that photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:49.66,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,Was that really Fudo-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:52.25,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,If it was, that girl next to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:55.63,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,Could she be... his girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:04:01.98,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,But is it really okay for me \Nto ask about his private life?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:04.99,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:08.53,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I think I know what you want to ask about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:09.72,main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:14.23,sign_6000_56_For_Those_Seekin,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(140,235)\fad(280,1)}For Those Seeking\N Muscle Growth\N\N\N{\fs13\c&H4EA3C0&} Rules for\N\N High-Efficiency\N\N Training\N\N{\c&HCABBB3&\fs8}\h\h\h\h\h\hBy Fudo Aikawa
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:14.23,sign_10159_85_Refreshing__Goes,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(325,270)\fad(280,1)}Refreshing!\NGoes down easy!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.65,0:04:13.38,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I think this should take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:14.23,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.48,sign_6000_56_For_Those_Seekin,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HDCD2D1&\frz-23.35\pos(178,93)\frx18\fry14\fs13}For Those Seeking\N Muscle Growth\N\N\N{\fs18\c&H60FFFF&} Rules for\NHigh-Efficiency\N Training
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.48,sign_10159_85_Refreshing__Goes,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz44.2\pos(400,205)}Refreshing!\NGoes down easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:18.23,main,Haru,0,0,0,,What's this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:21.66,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You've been with the squad \Nabout six months now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:23.30,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:27.76,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You'll be hitting a wall with your \Nstrength training around now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:28.24,main,Haru,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.47,0:04:29.91,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:31.20,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The same thing happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:33.71,main,Haru,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:36.99,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Follow this training regimen \Nover the next six months,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:39.10,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,and you'll obtain a body \Nof steel that will get you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:40.44,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,through just about any battle situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:41.13,top,Haru,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:44.62,main,Haru,0,0,0,,What I'm actually concerned \Nabout is the picture—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:49.47,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You're such a worrywart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:51.22,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:54.81,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The book does use pictures to explain \Nthe regimen's trickiest parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.41,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,And this kind of incremental \Nstrength training
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:05:00.22,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,is specially designed to minimize strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:02.96,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It should be easy to follow, \Neven for someone as small as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:05.82,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Since training that harms your \Nbody defeats the point, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:09.66,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's also important to do appropriate \Nstretches before each lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:12.44,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The graphs about that here \Nshould be easy to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:15.83,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,That will help increase the \Nflexibility of your muscles,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:19.03,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,and even promote swift \Nrecovery from injuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:22.34,top,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm not claiming you'll \Nsee results overnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.37,0:05:23.62,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,Now I know for certain...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:27.13,top,Fudo,0,0,0,,but anyone can get the body they want \Nwith sufficient application of effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:27.67,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,Senpai does not have a girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:29.35,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:32.97,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,When you make the call of effort,\N your muscles always answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.45,0:05:34.35,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,That should cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:37.67,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,That's what you wanted to ask, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:38.82,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:40.36,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:43.40,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for doubting you, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:46.86,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,They're calling us in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:49.40,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Let's go, Fudo-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:52.09,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Don't forget your book, Haru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.92,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:05:59.12,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Culverin Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:00.63,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Culverin Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:09.63,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,That's quite enough of that, Gekko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:16.64,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Freezing Sentai Gelato 5 has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:22.37,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Underestimate us on pain of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:26.04,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,It's about time, Gelato 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:28.65,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Today's the day I take you off the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.16,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:36.95,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:37.86,main,All,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:40.21,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,All right, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:42.34,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What will we chat about to—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:47.31,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.73,0:06:53.35,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Whoops. Guess my timing's a little off today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:55.97,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's okay. It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.97,0:06:58.52,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let's coordinate our movements, Desumi-sa—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:10.03,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'll dodge your first strike, then leap back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.07,0:07:12.53,sign_10312_117_Ignored,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz17.53\move(520,60,518,38)\fad(234,1)}Ignored
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:11.74,italics,,0,0,0,,Ignored...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:14.79,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:18.91,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:20.18,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:24.13,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,L-Let's move this elsewhere, Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:24.75,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:27.75,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Take this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:32.05,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Reaper Whirlwind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:32.47,sign_5871_55_Missing,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Rea{\alphaFF\t(377,378,\alpha00)}per {\alphaFF\t(752,753,\alpha00)}Whirl{\alphaFF\t(1128,1129,\alpha00)}wind
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:35.47,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I... I've never seen this move before!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:52.90,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:00.16,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,See? You shouldn't use moves you \Nhaven't practiced thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:04.76,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,H-Hold on, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.07,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.07,0:08:07.67,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Tell me what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:10.88,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I saw you two in the café!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:19.08,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I-It's not like that, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:19.97,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:23.02,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I was teaching Pink about bodybuilding—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:24.23,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:30.73,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I know better than anybody \Nthat you'd never cheat on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:35.63,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And yet, seeing the two of you together
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:37.88,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,sparked this hideous jealousy inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:41.51,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I found myself thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.45,0:08:45.58,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,maybe you don't belong \Nwith an outcast like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:47.50,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But with a girly girl like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:49.00,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,That isn't true!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:53.59,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You're the girliest girl I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:54.84,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:58.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I never used to be the kind of person \Nto worry about that sort of thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:06.44,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Love has made me weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:10.45,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Dating you has made me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:17.45,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A weak and pathetic mess of a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:19.87,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,That isn't true, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:29.86,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:32.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,The person I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:35.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just not...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:38.65,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,cut out for love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:09:59.75,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm a pretty awkward guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:01.93,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,But once I make up my mind about something,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:04.14,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I see it through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:09.34,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I will love you, and no one else,\N for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:16.95,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Will you trust me, and join me in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:24.71,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes, I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:33.95,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,That was rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.95,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:43.49,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I've seen an all-new side of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:46.18,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You can be surprisingly negative sometimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:47.00,sign_15496_166_Snap,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(100,20)\fad(85,1)}Snap
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:52.77,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo, I still haven't forgiven you \Nfor going on that afterschool date.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.77,0:10:55.87,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,W-Well, that wasn't exactly a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.87,0:10:57.13,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.65,0:11:01.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll take me on \Nan afterschool date, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.18,0:11:02.64,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Uniforms and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.64,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Then I'll forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:06.95,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I will! I promise I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:16.20,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:25.08,main,Haru,0,0,0,,It's all over, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.96,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.29,0:11:33.23,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,These two are busted!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:37.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Love After World Domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:42.97,sign_9447_74_1_Week_Earlier,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(535,65)}The\NNext\N Day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:11:56.31,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh, w-well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.97,0:11:58.09,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,This is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:00.07,flashback,Haru,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:02.22,flashback,Haru,0,0,0,,Let's head back, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:04.82,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:17.50,flashback italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:19.81,flashback italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,She hasn't said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:24.26,flashback italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Is it possible she {\i0}hasn't{\i1} figured us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:26.41,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,B-By the way, Haru-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.75,0:12:30.22,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,How much of our conversation did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.59,0:12:33.09,flashback,Haru,0,0,0,,After, "See? You shouldn't use moves \Nyou haven't practiced thoroughly..."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:35.73,flashback,Haru,0,0,0,,Or thereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.73,0:12:36.73,flashback italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:39.18,flashback italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,So, basically all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:41.97,flashback italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:43.47,flashback italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,{\fs20}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:45.15,flashback italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,{\fs16}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:46.75,flashback italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,{\fs12}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:49.24,sign_18408_198_The_End_of_Justi,Sign,0,0,0,,The End of Justice\N{\fs20\c&H80192B&\3c&H9E3A62&}Reaper Princess  {\fs30\c&H292F58&\3c&H331B4B&}Steamy Affair  {\fs20\c&H2F094D&\3c&H86316A&}Red
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.09,0:12:51.50,main,Prof,0,0,0,,How could you have done this, Fudo-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:51.50,sign_18408_198_The_End_of_Justi,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\c&HBD5387&\3c&H6F1935&}The End of Justice\N{\fs9\c&H86233F&\3c&HAA4265&}Reaper Princess   {\fs11\c&H4F547A&\3c&H331B4B&}Steamy Affair   {\fs9\c&H4A1255&\3c&H76306E&}Red
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:54.99,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Utterly unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.99,0:12:56.75,main,Daigo,0,0,0,,How do you intend to atone for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.03,0:12:58.75,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I'm so disappointed, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:03.73,main,Prof,0,0,0,,How could you have done this, Fudo-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:03.73,top,Hayato,0,0,0,,Utterly unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:03.73,top,Daigo,0,0,0,,How do you intend to atone for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:03.73,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I'm so disappointed, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:14.43,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,If that's the situation \Nthat awaits me in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:16.65,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,What will I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.31,0:13:19.19,main,Haru,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:28.55,main,Haru,0,0,0,,The meeting is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:30.41,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:33.21,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Good morning, Fudo-kun, Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:34.41,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.41,0:13:38.63,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Haru-kun would like to begin the \Nmeeting with an announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:41.43,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.43,0:13:43.96,main,Haru,0,0,0,,It's about me and Fudo-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:45.01,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's all...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:47.47,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Our end-of-term tests \Nare starting this week,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:48.39,main,Haru,0,0,0,,so we'll need to leave early.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:49.46,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,...not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:52.29,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Tests? Boy, that takes me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:54.02,main,Daigo,0,0,0,,Take care of yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:56.85,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.01,0:14:01.00,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Why did she do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:03.49,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.27,0:14:06.44,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Why indeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:11.03,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Why hasn't she said anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.49,0:14:16.00,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:18.06,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I don't know, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.06,0:14:21.02,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Haru-kun has been acting \Nnormal for the past week,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:23.50,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,both at work and at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:27.75,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What are you scheming, Pink Gelato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:30.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'll bet she's watching us as we speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:33.72,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's all right. That's why \Nwe're keeping our distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:40.69,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a civet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:45.44,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,This is torture! I'm at the end of my rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:47.47,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,If she insists on forcing my hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:50.36,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'll have to silence her forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:51.77,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,H-Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.77,0:14:53.02,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Hold it, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:55.66,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,No need to worry. I won't fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:14:57.12,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,T-That isn't what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:15:00.67,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm sure Haru-kun has her \Nown reasons for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:02.34,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let's wait and watch a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:11.62,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.67,0:15:15.23,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Would you mind buying me a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:20.39,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'd like a vanilla mocha, with nonfat milk,\N extra whip, and almonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:23.10,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Vanilla mocha, nonfat milk...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:24.20,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Hang on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:25.31,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let me write it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:29.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Vanilla mocha, nonfat milk, \Nextra whip, with almonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:33.07,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,R-Right. On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:34.11,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.03,0:15:41.19,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Shown yourself at last, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:49.46,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,There must be a reason why you're not \Ntelling anybody about our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:52.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Would you mind telling me what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.57,0:16:02.60,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:04.10,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:06.86,main,Haru,0,0,0,,That's what I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:09.97,main,Haru,0,0,0,,You'll accept my challenge, \Nwon't you, Reaper Princess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:13.70,main,Haru,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.12,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Second-year at Kokutei High School,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:17.37,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Desumi Magahara!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:19.87,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-How do you know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:20.89,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:24.33,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,Change, Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:43.64,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Her fighting technique has a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:47.31,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,That's right. She hasn't been \Non the team very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.59,0:16:51.66,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Can we stop this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:54.03,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.89,0:16:56.15,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I'm not finished yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:17:01.33,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Why is she so desperate to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:15.94,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.48,0:17:19.35,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You should probably lay \Nstill a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.03,0:17:22.71,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:26.85,main,Haru,0,0,0,,You really are strong, Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:31.36,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Please tell me. What are you after?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.71,0:17:35.38,main,Haru,0,0,0,,The reason I joined the team
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:38.30,main,Haru,0,0,0,,was because I was in love with Fudo-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:44.87,main,Haru,0,0,0,,That's why I started to \Nsuspect he had a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:50.17,main,Haru,0,0,0,,But I never dreamed his girlfriend \Nwould be an enemy commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:53.77,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.09,0:17:56.41,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's no wonder she hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:18:02.97,main,Haru,0,0,0,,But she also happened to be someone I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:04.15,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.67,0:18:07.98,main,Haru,0,0,0,,She was...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:16.44,main,Haru,0,0,0,,on that night, when I was attacked by thugs...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.95,0:18:21.48,main,Haru,0,0,0,,the one who saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:28.69,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,Become strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:37.03,main,Haru,0,0,0,,The person who saved me, \Nand said those words to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:44.73,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,That was {\i1}you{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.98,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I never dreamed you'd turn out \Nto be the Reaper Princess, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.77,0:18:57.08,main,Haru,0,0,0,,To be honest... I thought that if falling \Nin love really had made you weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:59.96,main,Haru,0,0,0,,then maybe I could steal him from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:02.24,main,Haru,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:05.99,main,Haru,0,0,0,,But you're as strong as you ever were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:07.67,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,W-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:11.50,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You could have destroyed our \Nrelationship without any of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:18.52,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I saw Fudo-senpai smiling in \Na way I've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:25.26,main,Haru,0,0,0,,So I just can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:33.43,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I don't have the right to \Nsteal happiness from the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:50.15,main,Haru,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.95,0:19:58.09,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.31,0:20:04.05,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Why are you crying, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.09,0:20:34.66,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:38.95,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I can find any of that vanilla almond \Nthing you were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:42.53,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Haru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.29,0:20:45.47,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:47.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Shh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.39,0:20:53.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Pink Gelato came by.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.42,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,She's sleeping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:00.90,sign_30185_313_Did_you_silence_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(300,20)\fad(200,1)}Pale
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:00.30,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Did you silence her forever?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:49.18,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I'm rooting for you two, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.81,0:23:00.27,main,Haru,0,0,0,,But if you give me the chance, \NI might just take him from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.20,0:23:07.40,main,Haru,0,0,0,,So, you'd better get along!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.06,0:23:12.66,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I know. We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.53,0:23:17.57,main,Haru,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.37,0:23:22.67,italics,Civet,0,0,0,,I am a civet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:25.75,italics,Civet,0,0,0,,This is the preview.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.75,0:23:36.43,italicstop,Civet,0,0,0,,Next Time: "Just the Way You Are."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:40.25,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(40,300)\fad(1005,1)}Episode 5     {\fsp4.1}Just the Way You Are
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.39,0:23:39.42,top,Desumi,0,0,0,,Why a civet?!
